	(text "Battery path (E-01 DECIDED): 1S protected cell -> J101 -> F101 5 A fuse -> J102 master switch -> VBAT.\nCharger (K-12 BQ25188) charges the cell on VBAT_FUSED. E-09: the charger is NEVER the load path:\nBQ25188 SYS (CHG_SYS) has only its required 10 uF and no load. Charge current set over I2C (OPEN B.19).\nCell protection is inside the pack (K-12 '1S protected cell'). Cell size/connector OPEN B.20."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "f6a4700f-4149-5e9e-9d9a-30b1007ddb0d")
	)
